      "body": "## Vote status\n\nSo far `60.00%` of the users with binding vote are in favor and `0.00%` are against (passing threshold: `51%`).\n\n### Summary\n\n|        In favor        |        Against        |       Abstain        |        Not voted        |\n| :--------------------: | :-------------------: | :------------------: | :---------------------: |\n| 3 | 0 | 0 | 2 |\n\n### Binding votes (3)\n\n| User | Vote  | Timestamp |\n| ---- | :---: | :-------: |\n| EduardoFromTheFuture | In favor | 2026-08-05 [redacted].0 +[redacted] |\n| ali-abrar | In favor | 2026-08-05 [redacted].0 +[redacted] |\n| jonathan-ieu | In favor | 2026-08-05 [redacted].0 +[redacted] |\n| @shaul-da | *Pending* | |\n| @heslin-zenith | *Pending* | |\n\n<details>\n    <summary><h3>Non-binding votes (1)</h3></summary>\n\n| User | Vote  | Timestamp |\n| ---- | :---: | :-------: |\n| Jatinp26 | In favor | 2026-08-05 [redacted].0 +[redacted] |\n</details>\n",
